OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with assaulting police
OL,4,
OL,5,FA 43-year-old man has been charged with
OL,6,Fassaulting police and possessing an
OL,7,Foffensive weapon.
OL,9,FIt comes after an incident in Newry,
OL,10,FCounty Down on Friday.
OL,12,FThere were reports that an armed man
OL,13,Fwas attempting to damage vehicles in
OL,14,Fthe Upper Water Street area at about
OL,15,F20:20 GMT.
OL,17,FThe weapons were discarded before
OL,18,Fpolice arrived and were then recovered
OL,19,Ffor examination. Two police officers
OL,20,Fwere assaulted with one sustaining
OL,21,Fminor injuries, however both remained
OL,22,Fon duty.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
